{"4727860":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"War Footing","steam_appid":4727860,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4795730],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/extras\/1d5b1cfa23a183d000a0ef0cfe01f984.avif?t=1792065570\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/extras_big\/1d5b1cfa23a183d000a0ef0cfe01f984.webp?t=1792065570 width=1560 height=260 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War Footing is a turn-based strategy game that puts you at the highest level of military command to mobilize a nation for defense rather than lead troops on the field. 8 scenarios offer distinct starting conditions, resource constraints, and enemy configurations.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE NATION'S EXISTENCE IS UP TO YOU<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Minister of Defense. You control the budget, the procurement contracts, the political relationships, and the force structure. Whether the army that meets the enemy is ready is entirely down to the decisions you make before the first shot is fired.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn represents a week. You'll spend them sourcing equipment from foreign suppliers or your own domestic industry, training and assigning units, and managing political stability to keep the budget flowing. When the invasion begins, the army you built is the army you fight with.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/extras\/47cbe74ce33c110b869ae6d7c260fb6e.avif?t=1792065570\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/extras_big\/47cbe74ce33c110b869ae6d7c260fb6e.webp?t=1792065570 width=1560 height=260 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> FROM DOCTRINE TO EQUIPMENT TO DEPLOYMENT<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise and outfit units from company to brigade level. Over 180 equipment types — small arms, armor, artillery, aircraft, and air defense systems — each with distinct trade-offs in cost, capability, and availability.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE DOMESTIC &amp; FOREIGN POLITICS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Military spending doesn't happen in a vacuum. Diplomatic obligations and political stability compete for the same resources. Ignoring them has consequences.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/extras\/6c68514fa1c4bbc077e738fb5d9e2abf.avif?t=1792065570\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/extras_big\/6c68514fa1c4bbc077e738fb5d9e2abf.webp?t=1792065570 width=1560 height=260 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEAD FROM THE TOP<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles resolve at the operational level - sector by sector, week by week. Outcomes depend on what you built: unit readiness, doctrine fit, equipment quality, and where you chose to deploy. A complex combat simulation rewards having combined arms and knowing your enemy.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/extras\/1d5b1cfa23a183d000a0ef0cfe01f984.avif?t=1792065570\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/extras_big\/1d5b1cfa23a183d000a0ef0cfe01f984.webp?t=1792065570 width=1560 height=260 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War Footing is a turn-based strategy game that puts you at the highest level of military command to mobilize a nation for defense rather than lead troops on the field. 8 scenarios offer distinct starting conditions, resource constraints, and enemy configurations.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE NATION'S EXISTENCE IS UP TO YOU<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Minister of Defense. You control the budget, the procurement contracts, the political relationships, and the force structure. Whether the army that meets the enemy is ready is entirely down to the decisions you make before the first shot is fired.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn represents a week. You'll spend them sourcing equipment from foreign suppliers or your own domestic industry, training and assigning units, and managing political stability to keep the budget flowing. When the invasion begins, the army you built is the army you fight with.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/extras\/47cbe74ce33c110b869ae6d7c260fb6e.avif?t=1792065570\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/extras_big\/47cbe74ce33c110b869ae6d7c260fb6e.webp?t=1792065570 width=1560 height=260 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> FROM DOCTRINE TO EQUIPMENT TO DEPLOYMENT<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise and outfit units from company to brigade level. Over 180 equipment types — small arms, armor, artillery, aircraft, and air defense systems — each with distinct trade-offs in cost, capability, and availability.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE DOMESTIC &amp; FOREIGN POLITICS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Military spending doesn't happen in a vacuum. Diplomatic obligations and political stability compete for the same resources. Ignoring them has consequences.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/extras\/6c68514fa1c4bbc077e738fb5d9e2abf.avif?t=1792065570\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/extras_big\/6c68514fa1c4bbc077e738fb5d9e2abf.webp?t=1792065570 width=1560 height=260 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEAD FROM THE TOP<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles resolve at the operational level - sector by sector, week by week. Outcomes depend on what you built: unit readiness, doctrine fit, equipment quality, and where you chose to deploy. A complex combat simulation rewards having combined arms and knowing your enemy.<\/p>","short_description":"War Footing puts you in command of a nation's defenses. With limited time &amp; resources, and tension rising, can you build the military needed to save your country's independence?","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/81dbb6590498e8559315dec705e04491d3412668\/header.jpg?t=1792065570","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/b269bc8a4b6b50c02c88d8e3fcd2bb956fc61fdd\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792065570","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4727860\/b269bc8a4b6b50c02c88d8e3fcd2bb956fc61fdd\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792065570","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-Bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-Core 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated Graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Strategist's Den Games"],"publishers":["Strategist's Den Games"],"demos":[{"appid":4795730,"description":""}],"price_o